        "original_id": "918d1f49-0441-5c5b-ae00-f5c59af6872b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: A Silent Film, The Frames\n- People: Robert Stevenson, Spencer Walker, Glen Hansard, Colm Mac Con Iomaire, Joe Doyle, Rob Bochnik, Graham Hopkins\n- Places: Dublin\n- Albums: Sand & Snow\n\nFacts:\n- The Frames are an Irish band based in Dublin.\n- A Silent Film consists of Robert Stevenson, who performs vocals, piano, and guitar, and Spencer Walker, who plays drums.\n- The Frames' current lineup, in addition to Glen Hansard, includes original member Colm Mac Con Iomaire, Joe Doyle, Rob Bochnik, and Graham Hopkins.\n- Sand & Snow is a studio album by the British alternative band A Silent Film that was released on June 5, 2012.",
